# NaMiOS-Sen — bang mau RIENG cua Plasma desktoptheme (KHAC voi
# usr/share/color-schemes/NaMiOS.colors — file do la KColorScheme cho ung dung;
# file nay la 'colors' cua desktoptheme, duoc Plasma::Theme doc lam mau MAC DINH
# cho chu/icon/vien ve TREN NEN kinh mo cua chinh theme nay — vd PlasmaCore.Theme
# ComplementaryColorGroup ma panel/dock/kickoff/task-switcher mac dinh dung, bat
# ke color-scheme ung dung dang la gi). Nguon mau DUY NHAT =
# usr/share/namios-branding/logo/brand.json (v2 "Sen Viet", 09/11/2026):
#   muc_dem #122A3A = 18,42,58     | chu_muc #182E3B = 24,46,59
#   son #C93643 = 201,54,67 (NHAN) | dai #92212E = 146,33,46 (ForegroundActive)
#   canh_light #E56365 = 229,99,101 | vang_tam #F2C66D = 242,198,109
#   gold_dark #E5A53E = 229,165,62  | fg #F7F6F1 = 247,246,241
#   fg-dim #B7C4CF = 183,196,207
# (09/11/2026 — doi tu jade #168A82/#64C3AA cua "Sen bung sang" v1.0, DA GO BO,
# sang do son #C93643/canh_light #E56365; ForegroundActive/BackgroundAlternate
# dung dai #92212E dam hon de doc duoc tren nen muc dem toi, cung logic WCAG da
# ap dung o usr/share/color-schemes/NaMiOS.colors.)
# Nen Window/Complementary/Header/View/Tooltip = navy toi (panel la kinh mo
# navy), chu ForegroundNormal = sang (fg) de doc duoc tren nen toi.
# verified_on_boot: NO — dung format .colors chuan (giong NaMiOS.colors da
# verify cau truc), nhung mau thuc te tren desktop theme chi xac nhan duoc khi
# boot Plasma that (xem docs/releases/boot-evidence).
#
# FIX 10/11/2026 (wave "desktop-theme designer senior"): 6 nhom
# Button/Tooltip/View/Window/Complementary/Header truoc day dat
# ForegroundPositive = 229,99,101 (canh_light) — TRUNG voi ForegroundActive/
# DecorationHover/ForegroundLink cua CHINH nhom do. Day la mot loi ngu nghia
# thuc: ForegroundPositive la mau PlasmaCore.Theme.positiveTextColor, duoc cac
# plasmoid he thong (pin/mang/battery, badge "xong") dung lam mau trang thai
# THANH CONG/DAT — dat no bang DUNG mau do nhan brand (cung mau voi hover/lien
# ket) se lam icon/chu "thanh cong" HIEN RA MAU DO, nguoi dung doc nham thanh
# "loi/canh bao" — vi pham chinh nguyen tac trung thuc mau sac cua
# docs/design/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md Sec5 ("khong truyen thong tin chi bang mau",
# ap dung ca huong nguoc: dung sai mau cho trang thai DAT). ForegroundNegative
# (217,77,67, do) va ForegroundNeutral (229,165,62, vang) khong bi loi nay —
# chi ForegroundPositive bi trung voi Active.
#
# Mau thay the = 89,199,152 (#59C798 — "status.success" nen TOI cua bo token
# Sen Viet v2 chinh thuc, branding/design-system/tokens.json, DA kiem tra WCAG
# 2.2: 7.09:1 tren surface.base #122A3A trong file tokens — tinh lai doi voi
# chinh cac nen dung trong file nay (#0B2034/#10202E/#172C3D) deu >= 6.86:1,
# vuot xa muc 4.5:1 chu thuong). Day la mau XANH LA DUY NHAT duoc dua vao file
# nay — brand.json (nguon mau DUY NHAT cho BRAND/logo) KHONG co token xanh la
# nao (chi do/vang/navy), nen mau "thanh cong" phai lay tu lop token NGU NGHIA
# UI rong hon (branding/design-system/tokens.json), khong phai tu brand.json —
# dung vi tri, khong vi pham "brand.json la nguon mau DUY NHAT" (quy tac do ap
# dung cho mau NHAN DIEN/logo, khong ap dung cho mau TRANG THAI chuc nang).
#
# verified_on_boot: NO — can boot Plasma that + mo mot plasmoid dung
# positiveTextColor (vd Battery & Brightness luc pin day/dang sac on dinh) de
# xac nhan bang mat mau xanh hien dung, khong con do. Rollback: doi ca 6 dong
# ForegroundPositive ben duoi lai thanh "229,99,101" (gia tri cu, truoc fix
# nay) — doc lap voi moi thay doi khac trong file, khong anh huong gi them.

